WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
Hi, my name is Langley. I'm the president of seelutions. I wanted to tell you quickly about my business.

00:04.500 --> 00:12.500
We started in 1983 as a graphic design business and in the late ’90s to early 2000s, I transformed it into a digital marketing agency doing SEO and website design.

00:12.500 --> 00:19.500
Along the way, I met Dr. Ryan Diepenbrock. He's a board-certified facial cosmetic surgeon up in Fort Wayne, Indiana.

00:19.500 --> 00:25.000
And we just had immediate bond and it's been a great relationship.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.000
I do SEO, I do website design, I do AI visibility for Dr. Diepenbrock.

00:32.000 --> 00:40.000
And right now, he's got more authority than any facial cosmetic surgeon in the geographical area in Fort Wayne.

00:40.000 --> 00:47.000
He's ranked number one for facelifts, rhinoplasty, blepharoplasty. He is really doing great.

00:47.000 --> 00:54.000
And that being said, we are looking for a few more plastic surgeons or cosmetic surgeons to work with.

00:54.000 --> 01:02.000
And it's as simple as emailing us or calling us and setting up a strategy call. We'll tell you what we do.

01:02.000 --> 01:08.000
We'll see if we have a nice fit and we'll take it from there.

01:08.000 --> 01:15.000
I'd love for you to take a quick look at Dr. Diepenbrock's video testimonial on our website.

01:15.000 --> 01:21.000
And once again, we'd love to hear from you and talk to you soon.
